      "value": "<p>At 5th level, your atmospheric extractor expands its condensation field to recharge your allies' biosystems.</p><p>Whenever you finish a Short Rest, you can choose up to <strong>3 friendly creatures within 30 feet</strong>. Each chosen creature regains an amount of expended Nanopool points equal to <strong>half your Nano-Technician level (rounded down) + your Intelligence modifier</strong> (minimum 1 point).</p><p>Once you use this feature, you cannot do so again until you finish a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p>"
